    "管理用户、机构、层级和研究权限；中央 PostgreSQL 是权威数据源，Manager SQLite 仅保留离线登录镜像。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Manage users, organizations, hierarchy, and research permissions; central PostgreSQL is authoritative and Manager SQLite keeps only the offline-login mirror."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"管理用户、机构、层级和研究权限；中央 PostgreSQL 是权威数据源，Manager SQLite 仅保留离线登录镜像。"}}}},
