    "机构是用户名和服务器管理范围的一级边界。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Organizations are the first-level boundary for usernames and server management scope."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"机构是用户名和服务器管理范围的一级边界。"}}}},
    "层级可以建立父子关系；用户和层级管理员必须属于同一机构。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hierarchy levels can form parent-child relationships; users and hierarchy managers must belong to the same organization."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"层级可以建立父子关系；用户和层级管理员必须属于同一机构。"}}}},
    "只有超级管理员可以管理用户、机构和层级。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Only a super administrator can manage users, organizations, and hierarchy levels."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只有超级管理员可以管理用户、机构和层级。"}}}},
    "中央控制数据库不可用；用户与机构管理不会使用本地陈旧副本。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The central control database is unavailable; user and organization administration will not use a stale local copy."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"中央控制数据库不可用；用户与机构管理不会使用本地陈旧副本。"}}}},
    "白名单浏览器设备自动登记失败，本次登录仍然有效" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Automatic allowlisted-browser enrollment failed; this login is still active."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"白名单浏览器设备自动登记失败，本次登录仍然有效"}}}},
