    "只有超级管理员可以开启、关闭或修改服务器互联" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Only super administrators can enable, disable, or modify server federation"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只有超级管理员可以开启、关闭或修改服务器互联"}}}},
