    "开启后本机通过 WireGuard 17998 向引导服务器登记；关闭后停止心跳" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"When enabled, this node registers with the bootstrap server over WireGuard port 17998; disabling stops the heartbeat"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"开启后本机通过 WireGuard 17998 向引导服务器登记；关闭后停止心跳"}}}},
    "只需填写一台已授权服务器的 WireGuard 17998 注册接口；其他节点由服务器目录发现" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enter the WireGuard port 17998 registration endpoint of one authorized server; other nodes are discovered from the server directory"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只需填写一台已授权服务器的 WireGuard 17998 注册接口；其他节点由服务器目录发现"}}}},
    "与引导 Manager 预共享的一次性或受限登记令牌" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A one-time or restricted registration token pre-shared with the bootstrap Manager"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"与引导 Manager 预共享的一次性或受限登记令牌"}}}},
    "只用于向引导 Manager 登记续租；跨服务器任务列表按需查询" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Used only to renew registration with the bootstrap Manager; the cross-server job list queries on demand"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只用于向引导 Manager 登记续租；跨服务器任务列表按需查询"}}}},
    "自动登记当前在线的所有服务端口；新建 issue worktree 并启动后会自动出现在互联节点目录" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Automatically register every online service port; a new issue worktree appears in the federated node directory after it starts"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自动登记当前在线的所有服务端口；新建 issue worktree 并启动后会自动出现在互联节点目录"}}}},
    "当前 Manager 互联状态" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Current Manager federation status"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"当前 Manager 互联状态"}}}},
