    "公网访问需要使用管理员创建的账户。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Public access requires an account created by an administrator."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"公网访问需要使用管理员创建的账户。"}}}},
    "当前已登记的公网访问用户与设备数量：暂时无法查询。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The number of registered public-access users and devices is temporarily unavailable."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"当前已登记的公网访问用户与设备数量：暂时无法查询。"}}}},
    "当前已登记的公网访问用户与设备数量：正在查询……" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Loading registered public-access users and devices…"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"当前已登记的公网访问用户与设备数量：正在查询……"}}}},
    "当前系统已登记的公网访问用户数：{users}；设备数：{devices}。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Registered public-access users on this system: {users}; devices: {devices}."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"当前系统已登记的公网访问用户数：{users}；设备数：{devices}。"}}}},
    "当前账户已登记的公网访问用户数：{users}；设备数：{devices}。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Registered public-access users for this account: {users}; devices: {devices}."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"当前账户已登记的公网访问用户数：{users}；设备数：{devices}。"}}}},
    "当前已登记的公网访问用户与设备数量：正在查询……（每个用户最多 {limit} 台设备）" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Loading registered public-access users and devices… (up to {limit} devices per user)"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"当前已登记的公网访问用户与设备数量：正在查询……（每个用户最多 {limit} 台设备）"}}}},
    "根据工信部及通信管理相关网络信息服务合规要求，本公网实例暂不开放自助注册；如需账号，请联系本服务管理员。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"To comply with MIIT and communications-administration requirements for online information services, this public instance does not offer self-service registration. Contact the service administrator if you need an account."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"根据工信部及通信管理相关网络信息服务合规要求，本公网实例暂不开放自助注册；如需账号，请联系本服务管理员。"}}}},
    "登记后系统会为安全审计记录粗粒度浏览器/客户端名称、登记来源 IP 和最近访问 IP；不会保存原始 User-Agent、浏览器指纹、MAC、IMEI 或定位。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"For security auditing, the system records a coarse browser or client name, enrollment source IP, and most recent access IP. It does not store the raw User-Agent, a browser fingerprint, MAC address, IMEI, or location."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"登记后系统会为安全审计记录粗粒度浏览器/客户端名称、登记来源 IP 和最近访问 IP；不会保存原始 User-Agent、浏览器指纹、MAC、IMEI 或定位。"}}}},
    "设备未获批准" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Device is not approved"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"设备未获批准"}}}},
    "切换并认证公网 Manager" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Switch to and authenticate with the public Manager"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"切换并认证公网 Manager"}}}},
    "发现并切换到最近公网 Manager" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Discover and switch to the nearest public Manager"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"发现并切换到最近公网 Manager"}}}},
    "没有可访问的公网 Manager。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No public Manager is reachable."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"没有可访问的公网 Manager。"}}}},
    "当前服务器 ID" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Current server ID"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"当前服务器 ID"}}}},
    "由内网 Manager 的服务器登记信息提供；切换公网时不在客户端硬编码" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Provided by the internal Manager's server registry; the client does not hardcode a public target"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"由内网 Manager 的服务器登记信息提供；切换公网时不在客户端硬编码"}}}},
    "尚未由服务器提供" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Not provided by the server yet"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"尚未由服务器提供"}}}},
    "已切换到服务器 %@（%@）" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Switched to server %@ (%@)"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已切换到服务器 %@（%@）"}}}},
    "已自动选择服务器 %@" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Automatically selected server %@"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已自动选择服务器 %@"}}}},
    "已通过原生设备密钥认证：%@" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Authenticated with the native device key: %@"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已通过原生设备密钥认证：%@"}}}},
    "原生设备公钥格式无效。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The native device public key is invalid."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"原生设备公钥格式无效。"}}}},
    "原生设备密钥不可用。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The native device key is unavailable."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"原生设备密钥不可用。"}}}},
    "当前设备绑定的用户与已登录用户不一致，已拒绝切换账号。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The account bound to this device does not match the signed-in account. Account switching was denied."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"当前设备绑定的用户与已登录用户不一致，已拒绝切换账号。"}}}},
    "原生设备签名失败。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Native device signing failed."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"原生设备签名失败。"}}}},
    "无法创建原生设备密钥。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Unable to create a native device key."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"无法创建原生设备密钥。"}}}},
    "服务器返回的设备挑战无效。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The server returned an invalid device challenge."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"服务器返回的设备挑战无效。"}}}},
    "设备认证地址无效。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The device-authentication address is invalid."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"设备认证地址无效。"}}}},
    "公网设备认证需要 HTTPS，不能使用公网 HTTP。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Public-device authentication requires HTTPS; public HTTP is not allowed."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"公网设备认证需要 HTTPS，不能使用公网 HTTP。"}}}},
    "使用浏览器设备密钥控制公网 FactorTester 访问" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Use a browser device key to control public FactorTester access"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"使用浏览器设备密钥控制公网 FactorTester 访问"}}}},
    "需要登录" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sign in required"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"需要登录"}}}},
    "我的设备" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"My devices"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"我的设备"}}}},
    "白名单用户通过公网访客模式登录后自动登记当前浏览器；可在此查看或撤销自己的设备" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"After an allowlisted user signs in through public visitor mode, the current browser is enrolled automatically; view or revoke your devices here"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"白名单用户通过公网访客模式登录后自动登记当前浏览器；可在此查看或撤销自己的设备"}}}},
    "登录后才能查看或撤销自己的设备" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sign in to view or revoke your devices"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"登录后才能查看或撤销自己的设备"}}}},
    "白名单设备自动登记" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Automatic allowlisted-device enrollment"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"白名单设备自动登记"}}}},
    "设备会绑定到当前登录用户" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The device is bound to the currently signed-in user"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"设备会绑定到当前登录用户"}}}},
    "自动登记方式" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enrollment method"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自动登记方式"}}}},
    "白名单用户在公网访客模式登录后，当前浏览器自动生成设备密钥并登记" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"After an allowlisted user signs in through public visitor mode, the current browser automatically generates a device key and enrolls it"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"白名单用户在公网访客模式登录后，当前浏览器自动生成设备密钥并登记"}}}},
    "仅公网访客模式" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Public visitor mode only"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仅公网访客模式"}}}},
    "公网设备总数" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Total public devices"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"公网设备总数"}}}},
    "私钥存储" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Private-key storage"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"私钥存储"}}}},
    "服务器只保存随机设备编号和公钥；私钥保存在当前浏览器的不可导出存储中" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The server stores only a random device ID and public key; the private key stays in this browser's non-exportable storage"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"服务器只保存随机设备编号和公钥；私钥保存在当前浏览器的不可导出存储中"}}}},
    "已登记设备" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Registered devices"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已登记设备"}}}},
    "尚未登记设备" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No devices have been registered"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"尚未登记设备"}}}},
    "设备名称只用于白名单管理，不参与设备识别" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The device name is only for allow-list management and is not used to identify the device"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"设备名称只用于白名单管理，不参与设备识别"}}}},
    "服务器只保存随机设备编号和公钥；公网私钥保存在对应来源浏览器的不可导出存储中" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The server stores only a random device identifier and public key; the public private key stays in non-exportable storage for that browser origin"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"服务器只保存随机设备编号和公钥；公网私钥保存在对应来源浏览器的不可导出存储中"}}}},
    "当前账户" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Current account"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"当前账户"}}}},
    "设备策略" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Device policy"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"设备策略"}}}},
    "白名单设备" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Allowlisted device"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"白名单设备"}}}},
    "所有已登记设备均来自白名单用户的公网访客自动登记" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Every registered device is enrolled automatically after an allowlisted user signs in through public visitor mode"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所有已登记设备均来自白名单用户的公网访客自动登记"}}}},
    "包括当前服务器已登记且启用的白名单设备" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Includes enabled allowlisted devices registered on this server"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"包括当前服务器已登记且启用的白名单设备"}}}},
    "公网访问用户数" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Public-access users"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"公网访问用户数"}}}},
    "当前统计范围内拥有启用公网设备的用户数量" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Users with an enabled public device in the current scope"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"当前统计范围内拥有启用公网设备的用户数量"}}}},
    "每个用户最多登记三台；撤销后可重新登记" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Each user may register up to three; revoked devices free a slot"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"每个用户最多登记三台；撤销后可重新登记"}}}},
    "设备将绑定到当前登录用户" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The device will be bound to the currently signed-in user"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"设备将绑定到当前登录用户"}}}},
    "存储位置" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Storage"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"存储位置"}}}},
    "服务器只保存随机设备编号和公钥；私钥保存在浏览器的不可导出存储中" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The server stores only a random device ID and public key; the private key stays in the browser's non-exportable storage"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"服务器只保存随机设备编号和公钥；私钥保存在浏览器的不可导出存储中"}}}},
    "公钥指纹" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Public-key fingerprint"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"公钥指纹"}}}},
