    "说明当前研究主张获得了什么程度的证据支持。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Describes the strength of evidence supporting the current research claim."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"说明当前研究主张获得了什么程度的证据支持。"}}}},
    "说明服务器实际接受并执行的冻结配置；它是结果证据的来源与身份依据，不是统计结果本身。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Describes the frozen configuration accepted and executed by the server; it identifies result evidence but is not the statistical result itself."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"说明服务器实际接受并执行的冻结配置；它是结果证据的来源与身份依据，不是统计结果本身。"}}}},
