    "说明本步骤取得的结果、指标、产物、限制和冲突。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Describes the results, metrics, artifacts, limitations, and conflicts produced by this step."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"说明本步骤取得的结果、指标、产物、限制和冲突。"}}}},
    "说明本步骤正文所引用的可审计研究对象。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Describes the auditable research object cited by this step."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"说明本步骤正文所引用的可审计研究对象。"}}}},
    "说明研究仍需回答的问题、重要性和当前收敛程度。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Describes the questions still open, their importance, and the current convergence."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"说明研究仍需回答的问题、重要性和当前收敛程度。"}}}},
    "说明研究由谁转接、转接了哪些范围与检查点。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Describes who handed off the research and which scope and checkpoints were transferred."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"说明研究由谁转接、转接了哪些范围与检查点。"}}}},
    "说明证据为何使研究义务或主张发生状态变化。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Describes why evidence changed a research obligation or claim state."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"说明证据为何使研究义务或主张发生状态变化。"}}}},
    "说明运行前拟提交的完整配置、RunSpec 哈希和可审计提交合同，用于事前审查及提交前后配置一致性核对。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Describes the complete proposed configuration, RunSpec hash, and auditable submission contract for pre-run review and consistency checks."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"说明运行前拟提交的完整配置、RunSpec 哈希和可审计提交合同，用于事前审查及提交前后配置一致性核对。"}}}},
