    "报告未按新协议完成，需重做：本地记录缺少 JOURNAL.json，没有经过校验的中文 journal。请让对应 research Agent 从可信 root 重新提交该分支的 checkpoint；客户端不会用旧 REPORT.md 或 INDEX.json 冒充完整报告。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This report does not comply with the current protocol and must be redone. The local record has no JOURNAL.json with a verified Chinese journal. Ask the research Agent to resubmit this branch checkpoint from the trusted root; the client will not treat an old REPORT.md or INDEX.json as a complete report."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "报告未按新协议完成，需重做：本地记录缺少 JOURNAL.json，没有经过校验的中文 journal。请让对应 research Agent 从可信 root 重新提交该分支的 checkpoint；客户端不会用旧 REPORT.md 或 INDEX.json 冒充完整报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
