    "这是只读会话副本。可以查看历史消息，但不能发送问题、修改文件、停止或删除 Agent。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This is a read-only conversation view. You can view history, but cannot send questions, modify files, stop, or delete the Agent."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"这是只读会话副本。可以查看历史消息，但不能发送问题、修改文件、停止或删除 Agent。"}}}},
    "会话属于当前研究身份；停止、解绑或更换 Agent 不会删除会话。对话事件不会把模型令牌或服务器本地路径发送给浏览器。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conversations belong to this research identity; stopping, unbinding, or replacing the Agent does not delete them. Chat events do not send model tokens or server-local paths to the browser."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"会话属于当前研究身份；停止、解绑或更换 Agent 不会删除会话。对话事件不会把模型令牌或服务器本地路径发送给浏览器。"}}}},
