    "模型服务只用于当前客户端或当前服务器上的 Agent；FactorTester 不会代替用户保存或转发令牌。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Model providers are used only by an Agent on this client or server; FactorTester does not save or forward tokens on the user's behalf."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"模型服务只用于当前客户端或当前服务器上的 Agent；FactorTester 不会代替用户保存或转发令牌。"}}}},
    "服务器凭证只保存在当前 Manager；客户端凭证由本地客户端管理。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Server credentials stay in the current Manager; client credentials are managed by the local client."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"服务器凭证只保存在当前 Manager；客户端凭证由本地客户端管理。"}}}},
    "服务器运行的模型服务必须使用 HTTPS。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Server-runtime model providers must use HTTPS."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"服务器运行的模型服务必须使用 HTTPS。"}}}},
    "令牌只写入当前运行时的本地加密存储，不会显示或同步到 PostgreSQL。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tokens are written only to encrypted local runtime storage; they are never displayed or synchronized to PostgreSQL."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"令牌只写入当前运行时的本地加密存储，不会显示或同步到 PostgreSQL。"}}}},
